{"sha":"1caff0340f49c93d535c6558a5138d20d475315c","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0NDQ3OTc2OjFjYWZmMDM0MGY0OWM5M2Q1MzVjNjU1OGE1MTM4ZDIwZDQ3NTMxNWM=","commit":{"author":{"name":"Jason Wang","email":"jasowang@redhat.com","date":"2021-02-24T04:13:22Z"},"committer":{"name":"Jason Wang","email":"jasowang@redhat.com","date":"2021-03-15T08:41:22Z"},"message":"e1000: switch to use qemu_receive_packet() for loopback\n\nThis patch switches to use qemu_receive_packet() which can detect\nreentrancy and return early.\n\nThis is intended to address CVE-2021-3416.\n\nCc: Prasad J Pandit <ppandit@redhat.com>\nCc: qemu-stable@nongnu.org\nReviewed-by: Philippe Mathieu-Daudé <philmd@redhat.com>\nSigned-off-by: Jason Wang <jasowang@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7bfab49856f2cb976c35e7f8faffd796bcdec1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bonzini/qemu/git/trees/c7bfab49856f2cb976c35e7f8faffd796bcdec1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bonzini/qemu/git/commits/1caff0340f49c93d535c6558a5138d20d475315c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bonzini/qemu/commits/1caff0340f49c93d535c6558a5138d20d475315c","html_url":"https://github.com/bonzini/qemu/commit/1caff0340f49c93d535c6558a5138d20d475315c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bonzini/qemu/commits/1caff0340f49c93d535c6558a5138d20d475315c/comments","author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"sha":"705df5466c98f3efdd2b68d3b31dad86858acad7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bonzini/qemu/commits/705df5466c98f3efdd2b68d3b31dad86858acad7","html_url":"https://github.com/bonzini/qemu/commit/705df5466c98f3efdd2b68d3b31dad86858acad7"}],"stats":{"total":2,"additions":1,"deletions":1},"files":[{"sha":"4f75b44cfcba6ac6d00d43b238d0e586be28eecf","filename":"hw/net/e1000.c","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/bonzini/qemu/blob/1caff0340f49c93d535c6558a5138d20d475315c/hw%2Fnet%2Fe1000.c","raw_url":"https://github.com/bonzini/qemu/raw/1caff0340f49c93d535c6558a5138d20d475315c/hw%2Fnet%2Fe1000.c","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bonzini/qemu/contents/hw%2Fnet%2Fe1000.c?ref=1caff0340f49c93d535c6558a5138d20d475315c","patch":"@@ -546,7 +546,7 @@ e1000_send_packet(E1000State *s, const uint8_t *buf, int size)\n \n     NetClientState *nc = qemu_get_queue(s->nic);\n     if (s->phy_reg[PHY_CTRL] & MII_CR_LOOPBACK) {\n-        nc->info->receive(nc, buf, size);\n+        qemu_receive_packet(nc, buf, size);\n     } else {\n         qemu_send_packet(nc, buf, size);\n     }"}]}